Subject: [PATCH] [M157] SimpleCache: fix cleanup bug on key collision (at file level)

Original change's description:
> SimpleCache: fix cleanup bug on key collision (at file level)
>
> The old file removal code relied on sparse_file_open_ being set, but it
> won't be for the colliding case since we won't get this far, spotting
> the problem at _0 file.
